    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Vector-valued function described by up to 3 individual ParsedFunctions. The parameter <computeroutput>lower</computeroutput> is the first vector component in the solution vector.</para>
<para>This Function does no override the set_time function, instead it assumes that time has been correctly updated in each underlying ParsedFunction. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
